                  "limitations": "Only two explicitly supported publisher NZAD suburbs, qualified by city; site locality IDs are not official geography codes and do not establish TA, SA2 or postal boundaries. Figures are provisional, incomplete or revisable during bond-system migration. Late lodgements and administrative changes can alter results; no rent-trend inference is established. Absent dwelling/bedroom tuples are not_reported, not zero or inferred suppression.",
