          "revision_policy": "Previous months and longer histories can be revised. Retain the publisher revision metadata; current values are not a vintage archive.",
          "limitations": "Administrative claimant stock, not ILO unemployment, a claimant rate or available recruits. Universal Credit eligibility, work-search conditions, rollout, classification and policy changes affect coverage and comparisons; arrangements can differ in Northern Ireland. JSA and relevant UC claimants are combined under the publisher definition; overlapping benefit populations must not be added again. Exact retained national months only; no local areas, seasonal adjustment, missing-to-zero conversion or older-release substitution."
